\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Exp\nobreakspace  {}III: unified comparison of direct inference, RL, self-evolution, and self-evolution+RL.} Scores are accuracy (\%). Chart and Table entries follow the VTool-R1 protocol; their RL rows are VTool-R1 GRPO results and their \textsc  {EvoAgent}{}+RL rows add the self-evolved capability on top of the RL-trained policy. V$^\star $ and HRBench4K entries follow the DeepEyes high-resolution evaluation; their RL rows are DeepEyes results where reported. A dash means the corresponding same-backbone or combined run is not reported in the source table and is not inferred here. \relax }}{12}{table.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
